menu "Transmitter Diagnostics"

    config TRANSMITTER_DIAGNOSTICS_SCAN_START_ADDR
        int "Modbus slave scan range start"
        default 1
        range 1 247
        help
            First Modbus slave address probed when searching for the transmitter.

    config TRANSMITTER_DIAGNOSTICS_SCAN_END_ADDR
        int "Modbus slave scan range end"
        default 16
        range 1 247
        help
            Last Modbus slave address probed when searching for the transmitter.
            Keep this small for fast boot-time scans; widen if the unit can sit
            on any address.

endmenu
